Done. `MIGRATION.md` is saved in the workdir. Here's what it covers:

**Six breaking changes**, each with its own section and before/after examples:

| # | Change | Impact |
|---|--------|--------|
| 1 | `/tasks` → `/v2/tasks` | Every endpoint URL changes |
| 2 | `X-Auth-Token` → `Authorization: Bearer` | All auth configs need new credentials |
| 3 | `id`: integer → UUID string | Type definitions, lookups, local ID caches all change |
| 4 | `done` → `completed` | Every read/write path on task objects |
| 5 | `project_id` required on create | Task creation fails with 422 without it |
| 6 | Bare array → paginated envelope | List parsing changes; cursor-based pagination replaces offset |

The guide ends with an 11-item migration checklist and the upgrade command (`pip install --upgrade zrb`).
